{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass after these things, etc.</b> The meaning of הַדְּבָרִים is the matters recounted above concerning this subject — that many trials had befallen him until he was granted a son in his old age, and HaShem had also promised him ״כִּי בְיִצְחָק יִקָּרֵא לְךָ זָרַע״, and after Yitzhak had grown, as it says ״וַיָּגָר אַבְרָהָם בְּאֶרֶץ פְּלִשְׁתִּים יָמִים רַבִּים״ — and in the first year that he went down to the land of the Pelishtim, Yitzhak was born; from this you learn that he was grown. And given all the foregoing, the magnitude of the trial would be wondrous — both from the perspective of Avraham, for after many trials had preceded it until he was granted a son, and after many promises from HaShem that through Yitzhak his seed would be called, He nevertheless tells him to offer him up and he did not harbor any hesitation in his heart; and from the perspective of Yitzhak, for even though he was grown, as may be heard from the adjacent verse ״וַיָּגָר״ etc. — from this you learn that he was grown, yet he did not object. Further, it intends to say <b>after these things</b> because through this it is justified to say to him ״אֶת בִּנְךָ אֶת יְחִידְךָ״ and not before the matters recounted in the adjacent passage, for he still had Yishmael and he would not be his only one." "<b>And the Elohim tested, etc.</b> He said ״וְהָאֱלֹהִים״ with the addition of the letter vav and the addition of the letter hei, to say that besides the trials that preceded it, He added to test him with the rigor of din a tremendous trial." "<b>And He said to him: Avraham.</b> The reason for the calling was to inform him beforehand that the Elohim had come to ask of him a great thing, and Avraham understood and said to him <b>Here I am</b> — meaning, I am prepared for whatever you shall say to me."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:42:45.803773355Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}